title Vinyl P2d: Playback with Crossfade after Gapless (Playback-480x320 of the canvas), its pick list (Off, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 s) with the albums-stay-gapless line; a choice closes the list and Playback shows it; Enter and the keys as on the other pick lists
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE playback

wait 900
shot 01-playback
expect text "Gapless"
expect text "Crossfade"
expect text "ReplayGain"
tap "Crossfade"
wait 400
shot 02-crossfade-list
expect text "CROSSFADE"
expect text "10 s"
expect text "The end of a track overlaps the start of the next. Tracks of one album stay gapless; Next and Previous change at once."
tap "6 s"
wait 400
shot 03-playback-6s
expect text "6 s"
# the keys: Down to Crossfade, Enter opens the list on the chosen value, Up and Enter choose 4 s
key down
key enter
wait 400
expect text "CROSSFADE"
key up
key enter
wait 400
shot 04-playback-4s
expect text "4 s"
expect noquit
